        "issue": "TEAM-ORIENTATION-RESEAL-001",
        "reason": "That issue already owns footer-and-receipt bookkeeping that invalidates an otherwise complete turn; this is the same class with a different field, and it strengthens its case for making the required references explicit in the generated brief rather than left to recall."
      }
